###GUIDEBOOK SECTION
###Guidebook is made up of menus with a title, body and at least one button. I grouped them here per page of the guidebook for context.
###Buttons lead deeper into sub menus except of course for the back button.

###LANDING PAGE
cyd_mgspl.menu_main_title=§lTome of Magic	###guidebook landing page title
cyd_mgspl.menu_main_body=The §d§lTome of Magic§r has all the magic knowledge you will need. Learn about magic spells, new magical items and adjust your settings here.	###guidebook landing menu text
cyd_mgspl.menu_button_tutorial=How it works	###guidebook landing page button that leads to the tutorial page
cyd_mgspl.menu_button_spells=List of Spells	###guidebook landing page button that leads to the spell list
cyd_mgspl.menu_button_items=List of Items	###guidebook landing page button that leads to the item list
cyd_mgspl.menu_button_settings=Add-On Settings	###guidebook button that leads to the settings menu
cyd_mgspl.menu_button_about=About	###guidebook button that leads to the credits sections
cyd_mgspl.menu_button_return=Back	###guidebook generic button to navigate backwards in a menu structure

###GUIDEBOOK TUTORIAL
cyd_mgspl.menu_tutorial_title=§lMagic spells Tutorial	###guidebook tutorial page title
cyd_mgspl.menu_tutorial_body=To start with §dMagic Spells§r you need to find a §bManamote§r. Hostile mobs like skeletons or zombies have a small chance to drop one.%1%1In forest areas keep an eye out for magical §bWisps§r who are guaranteed to drop at least one §bManamote§r!%1%1Once you collect your first §bManamote§r the crafting recipes will unlock in the recipe menu of any crafting table.%1%1In depth descriptions for every item can be found in the §dSpells§r and §eItems§r sections of the Tome of Magic.	###guidebook tutorial section menu text, use double line breaks to separate paragraphs

cyd_mgspl.menu_button_howtospells=How do I cast Spells?	###guidebook tutorial section button that leads to the spellcasting explain page
cyd_mgspl.menu_button_mana=What is Mana?	###guidebook button that leads to the mana explain page

###GUIDEBOOK TUTORIAL CASTING
cyd_mgspl.menu_howtospell_title=§lHow do I cast Spells?	###guidebook spellcasting explain page title
cyd_mgspl.menu_howtospell_body=Once you have crafted a §dMagic Spell§r you can use interact to cast it.%1Each spell uses a portion of your §bMana§r so make sure to have enough of it before casting.%1%1Some §dSpells§r can be §cchanneled§r or §ccharged§r. Instead of tapping the button to cast you have to hold it down to trigger the effect.%1%1You can look up detailed descriptions for every spell in the §dSpell List§r of the Tome of Magic.	###guidebook spellcasting explainer section menu text, use double line breaks to separate paragraphs
cyd_mgspl.menu_button_list=Show me the Spells!	###guidebook button that leads to the spell list

###GUIDEBOOK TUTORIAL MANA
cyd_mgspl.menu_mana_title=§lWhat is Mana?	###guidebook mana explain page title
cyd_mgspl.menu_mana_body=Mana represents your magic potential to cast §dSpells§r.%1%1By default you have §b100 Mana§r at your disposal. After you use some of it to cast a spell your §bMana§r will regenerate naturally at a rate of §b2 Points§r each second.%1%1Wearing special §eMagic Attire§r can enhance your magic potential further.%1%1You can restore portions of your §bMana§r quicker by consuming magic §ePotions§r or §eMana Cookies§r.	###guidebook mana explainer menu text, use double line breaks to separate paragraphs
cyd_mgspl.menu_button_armor=Magic Attire?	###guidebook button that leads to the armor explain page
cyd_mgspl.menu_button_potions=Magic Potions?	###guidebook button that leads to the potion explain page

###GUIDEBOOK ITEM LIST
cyd_mgspl.menu_item_title=§lList of magic Items	###guidebook list of items title
cyd_mgspl.menu_item_body=Here you will find the best §eItems§r to help you excel as a §dSpellcaster§r.	###guidebook list of items menu text
cyd_mgspl.menu_item_armor=Magic Attire	###guidebook button that leads to the armor explain page
cyd_mgspl.menu_item_potions=Magic Potions	###guidebook button that leads to the armor explain page

###GUIDEBOOK ITEMS ARMOR
cyd_mgspl.menu_armor_title=§lMagic Armor	###guidebook armor explain page title
cyd_mgspl.menu_armor_body=Infusing ordinary cloth with §bManamotes§r at a crafting table yields an armor suited for §dSpellcasting§r like no other.%1Magic armor is surprisingly durable, can be enchanted to high levels and provides these extra bonuses:%1%1§eMagic Hat §b+1 Mana regeneration§r%1§eMagic Robe §b+10 Maximum Mana§r%1§eMagic Leggings §b+10 Maximum Mana§r%1§eMagic Boots §b+5 Maximum Mana§r%1%1Magic Armor can be repaired at an anvil using wool or a §bManamote§r.	###guidebook armor section menu text, use double line breaks to separate paragraphs

###GUIDEBOOK ITEMS POTIONS
cyd_mgspl.menu_potions_title=§lMagic Potions	###guidebook potions and consumables page
cyd_mgspl.menu_potions_body=§eMana Cookies§r are crafted by infusing ordinary cookies with a §bManamote§r on a crafting table. This process not only makes them more tasty but also makes them restore §b25 Mana.§r%1%1Drinking a §eMana Potion§r restores a whopping §b75 Mana§r instantly. To make one just melt down a §bManamote§r into water bottles at a brewing stand.%1%1The §eMind Potion§r vastly boosts your ability to generate §bMana§r for §b60 seconds§r.	###guidebook potion and consumables explainer menu text, use double line breaks to separate paragraphs

