cyd_mgspl.spell_hint_none=%1	###placeholder hint for tech reasons, keep just the linebreak here - thanks
cyd_mgspl.spell_hint_channelling=%1§cChannelling:§f this spell will be cast repeatedly while holding interact as long as the caster has sufficient mana, before it goes on cooldown.%1%1	###spell type description hint, spells can only have one type
cyd_mgspl.spell_hint_charging=%1§cCharging:§f this spell can accumulate charges to increase its power. To charge up hold interact, then release to cast the spell.%1%1	###spell type description hint, spells can only have one type

cyd_mgspl.enderblight.desc=Conjure a large patch of radiant enderblight on the ground that damages mobs within every second.	###spell description
cyd_mgspl.fireball.desc=Shoot a flaming projectile that ignites and damages the first target it hits. Also deals damage to additional mobs in a small area around the impact location.	###spell description
cyd_mgspl.gravity_vortex.desc=Create a Vortex that sucks in nearby mobs. Creatures trapped in the center of the effect take damage every second.	###spell description
cyd_mgspl.ice_blast.desc=Blast mobs in a cone in front of you with a cutting wave of ice.	###spell description
cyd_mgspl.illuminate.desc=Conjure a glimmering lightsource at the target location within range that will linger for a limited amount of time.	###spell description
cyd_mgspl.levitation.desc=Gain the ability to fly for a limited amount of time.	###spell description
cyd_mgspl.lightning_strike.desc=Call down lightning at the target location within range to damage mobs within its area of effect. This spell also charges creepers.	###spell description
cyd_mgspl.mineblast.desc=Clears out an area of blocks at the target location within range to allow quick mining. Does not damage creatures.	###spell description
cyd_mgspl.polymorph.desc=Temporarily transforms a hostile mob into a cute and harmless critter.%1%1§cDoes not work on enemies with very high maximum health like bosses.§r	###spell description
cyd_mgspl.push.desc=Forcefully push away all mobs around you.	###spell description
cyd_mgspl.return.desc=Conjure a magic circle on the ground. After 3 seconds players and mobs within the circle will be teleported to your spawnpoint.%1%1§cFor this spell to work you need to have previously set your spawnpoint at a bed.§r	###spell description
cyd_mgspl.summon_minion.desc=Summon an allied creature that helps you in combat.	###spell description
cyd_mgspl.timewarp.desc=Rapidly speed up the time of day. Turn day into night and night into day within seconds.	###spell description
cyd_mgspl.whirlwind.desc=Summon a Whirlwind of amazing speed that seeks out hostiles and hurls them into the air. Only works against ground based targets.	###spell description
cyd_mgspl.witherskulls.desc=Shoot up to 5 Witherskulls from the Nether that seek out nearby mobs and explode.	###spell description

